WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:35.980 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 18]

01:47.330 --> 01:48.090
Xuan.

01:48.560 --> 01:50.380
What about the two from Yellow Maple Valley?

01:51.430 --> 01:51.860
Lv,

01:52.070 --> 01:52.780
calm down.

01:53.280 --> 01:54.490
We can find an opening to ditch

01:55.000 --> 01:55.940
the Foundation Establishment

01:56.230 --> 01:57.170
cultivators.

02:11.880 --> 02:12.450
Xuan'er!

02:14.520 --> 02:15.180
Xuan'er!

02:15.280 --> 02:16.050
Dong Xuan'er?

02:25.750 --> 02:26.090
Xuan'er.

02:26.470 --> 02:26.980
What happened to you?

02:27.000 --> 02:27.330
Dong Xuan'er.

02:28.390 --> 02:29.260
Senior Wu.

02:29.670 --> 02:30.500
Hurry.

02:31.320 --> 02:32.370
Senior Han is...

02:32.670 --> 02:33.370
What happened to Han Li?

02:33.640 --> 02:34.860
He needs your help now.

02:35.280 --> 02:35.980
Where is he?

02:38.240 --> 02:38.690
Xuan'er.

02:39.110 --> 02:39.860
Xuan'er, what's wrong?

02:40.920 --> 02:41.330
Everyone,

02:41.680 --> 02:43.380
Xuan'er escaped from the Yan Clan Stronghold.

02:43.560 --> 02:44.900
I must send her to the Valley.

02:45.510 --> 02:46.100
Go now.

02:46.840 --> 02:47.900
We'll go rescue Han.

02:52.040 --> 02:52.620
Xuan'er...

03:31.400 --> 03:32.490
I feel much better now.

03:36.310 --> 03:37.100
The demonic sects

03:37.790 --> 03:38.930
might be on the way back.

03:40.200 --> 03:41.100
I should take a detour.

04:05.340 --> 04:06.220
My seniors,

04:06.520 --> 04:07.780
aren't we going to rescue Han?

04:08.240 --> 04:09.010
This is the wrong way.

04:11.360 --> 04:11.820
Chen.

04:12.840 --> 04:13.890
The elder sent us a message.

04:14.360 --> 04:15.010
The Yan Clan Stronghold

04:15.030 --> 04:16.780
owns a gem quarry nearby.

04:17.030 --> 04:18.380
The demonic sects must not seize it.

04:19.120 --> 04:20.690
We are ordered to take it immediately.

04:25.680 --> 04:26.220
Han Li?

04:26.590 --> 04:27.340
Why are you here?

04:28.190 --> 04:29.010
What is she doing here?

04:29.710 --> 04:30.340
Senior Chen.

04:34.280 --> 04:35.060
Is he from

04:35.120 --> 04:36.170
the Yellow Maple Valley?

04:37.000 --> 04:37.570
I am Lv Tianmeng

04:37.680 --> 04:38.450
from

04:38.560 --> 04:39.220
Spirit Beast Mountain.

04:40.360 --> 04:40.980
I am Xuan Yue

04:41.470 --> 04:42.100
from Moonshadow Sect.

04:44.740 --> 04:45.890
I am Han Li from Yellow Maple Valley.

04:46.460 --> 04:47.660
I escaped from the Yan Clan Stronghold.

04:49.280 --> 04:49.820
Han.

04:50.430 --> 04:51.100
Are you alright?

04:51.750 --> 04:53.290
You look badly hurt.

04:58.630 --> 05:00.010
No one else can find out

05:00.470 --> 05:01.660
about the change in our route.

05:02.190 --> 05:03.450
We must keep this person here.

05:05.080 --> 05:06.100
Agreed.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.060
What's with these two?

05:08.870 --> 05:09.380
This is weird.

05:10.520 --> 05:12.500
For you to escape the Yan Clan Stronghold

05:13.120 --> 05:14.610
proves you are highly capable.

05:15.590 --> 05:16.240
The rest of us

05:16.280 --> 05:17.130
were sent on a mission

05:17.310 --> 05:18.130
by the Seven Sects.

05:18.800 --> 05:20.060
Things are urgent right now.

05:20.430 --> 05:20.780
Join us.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.130
We can watch

05:22.310 --> 05:22.980
each other's backs.

05:24.280 --> 05:24.980
Senior Xuan.

05:25.590 --> 05:27.060
Since Han is injured,

05:27.400 --> 05:28.500
he should return to the Valley.

05:29.280 --> 05:30.100
We can handle

05:30.400 --> 05:31.290
the mission.

05:33.000 --> 05:33.610
Chen.

05:34.080 --> 05:35.220
The coalition gave an order.

05:35.680 --> 05:36.730
All Foundation Establishment disciples

05:36.960 --> 05:37.890
were assigned missions.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.450
Lv has the coalition's official dispatch

05:40.750 --> 05:41.290
as proof.

05:42.710 --> 05:43.570
Han.

05:43.960 --> 05:45.060
Please lend us a hand.

05:45.910 --> 05:47.290
Please don't turn us down.

05:48.630 --> 05:49.290
It seems they are

05:49.960 --> 05:50.690
ready to accuse me

05:51.310 --> 05:52.340
- if I refuse... - Han.

05:52.360 --> 05:52.890
to help them.

05:52.950 --> 05:53.410
Please.

05:54.270 --> 05:54.930
No choice then.

05:55.560 --> 05:56.540
I'll play it by ear.

05:57.310 --> 05:57.900
I accept the order.

05:58.720 --> 05:59.250
I'll go with you.

06:11.950 --> 06:12.340
Senior Chen.

06:12.920 --> 06:13.850
What's going on

06:14.120 --> 06:15.020
with these two?

06:16.360 --> 06:17.410
We were originally ordered

06:17.430 --> 06:18.810
to scout the Yan Clan Stronghold.

06:19.510 --> 06:21.020
But they suddenly changed course.

06:21.600 --> 06:22.930
They claimed to have received

06:23.270 --> 06:24.900
an order to seize a gem quarry.

06:25.830 --> 06:26.730
A gem quarry?

06:28.270 --> 06:29.780
The Yan Clan Stronghold is overrun.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.290
With just a few of us,

06:33.120 --> 06:34.100
even if we take it,

06:34.510 --> 06:35.460
can we hold it?

06:51.070 --> 06:51.730
Why did you come?

06:52.360 --> 06:53.900
I couldn't just let you go rescue them

06:53.920 --> 06:55.290
on your own.

06:55.950 --> 06:56.540
Don't worry,

06:56.920 --> 06:57.980
I can handle it alone.

06:58.510 --> 06:59.980
The big battle is coming, and we need you

07:00.240 --> 07:01.580
at the front lines to hold the fort.

07:02.720 --> 07:03.610
We don't even know

07:03.800 --> 07:05.100
how many enemies are coming this time.

07:06.000 --> 07:07.460
I heard that person leading them.

07:09.310 --> 07:10.370
That is the very reason

07:10.480 --> 07:11.220
I must go.

07:15.750 --> 07:16.850
Siding with the demonic sects...

07:22.310 --> 07:22.900
Xuan'er!

07:23.070 --> 07:23.700
Are they back?

07:26.630 --> 07:27.170
- Xuan'er! - Master!

07:27.310 --> 07:27.900
Master!

07:28.000 --> 07:28.370
Mentor.

07:28.480 --> 07:28.980
Mentor.

07:29.430 --> 07:31.140
The Lord of the Yan Clan Stronghold sided with the demonic sects.

07:31.390 --> 07:33.170
Han fought to protect me so I could get back.

07:33.360 --> 07:35.610
He's still fighting those villains.

07:35.920 --> 07:36.900
Please go save him

07:37.160 --> 07:38.340
before it's too late.

07:38.560 --> 07:39.250
Alright.

07:39.630 --> 07:40.250
Understood.

07:40.680 --> 07:41.730
Here, take this.

07:42.390 --> 07:42.930
Quick.

07:47.480 --> 07:48.730
He is in danger right now.

07:49.190 --> 07:50.050
You must go help him.

07:50.630 --> 07:51.220
Go, now.

07:54.000 --> 07:54.610
Wu Xuan.

07:55.270 --> 07:55.730
Yes, Master.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.340
Take good care of her.

07:57.680 --> 07:59.100
Without your mentor's permission,

07:59.310 --> 08:00.930
she is not to leave the Valley.

08:02.560 --> 08:03.580
Stop standing there.

08:03.600 --> 08:04.850
She just escaped death.

08:04.920 --> 08:05.740
Do you think she'll

08:05.830 --> 08:07.050
get that lucky again next time?

08:07.390 --> 08:08.250
Yes, Master.

08:09.160 --> 08:09.660
Hold her.

08:15.750 --> 08:16.460
Alright.

08:16.750 --> 08:17.780
Xuan'er is safe.

08:19.870 --> 08:21.170
But your disciple...

08:21.720 --> 08:22.340
I sent Liu Jing

08:22.560 --> 08:23.220
to search for him.

08:24.630 --> 08:26.100
That rascal is pretty clever.

08:26.870 --> 08:28.810
Since he was able to get Xuan'er out,

08:29.070 --> 08:31.050
he must be confident he can escape on his own too.

08:33.270 --> 08:34.050
That would be best.

08:34.630 --> 08:36.170
If he returns safely this time,

08:36.560 --> 08:37.580
as his mentor,

08:38.000 --> 08:39.220
I'll have to reward him.

08:40.270 --> 08:41.250
But with this turn of events,

08:41.510 --> 08:42.930
Xuan'er's identity may be exposed.

08:43.750 --> 08:44.730
If she runs into that person,

08:45.560 --> 08:46.220
what then?

08:50.000 --> 08:51.020
Don't worry, Hongfu.

08:52.120 --> 08:53.470
With me here,

08:53.470 --> 08:55.370
I won't let anyone harm you two.

08:56.390 --> 08:57.930
Quit acting like a hero.

08:58.120 --> 08:58.660
Don't forget,

08:59.040 --> 08:59.900
you still can't beat me.

09:00.950 --> 09:01.610
Give it a rest.

09:02.750 --> 09:03.170
Enough.

09:03.270 --> 09:03.930
Don't worry.

09:04.390 --> 09:05.370
The war is top priority.

09:06.000 --> 09:07.050
We must head to the front lines,

09:07.310 --> 09:08.340
and stop the demonic sects.

09:10.000 --> 09:10.490
Exactly.

09:20.560 --> 09:21.220
This is the place.

09:23.120 --> 09:24.580
It seems the guards here

09:24.750 --> 09:25.460
are mostly mortals

09:25.600 --> 09:26.660
and low-level cultivators.

09:28.120 --> 09:29.250
Nightfall is near.

09:29.680 --> 09:30.460
No time to waste.

09:31.040 --> 09:32.290
Before the enemy army arrives,

09:32.680 --> 09:33.810
