09:34.800 --> 09:35.250
Senior Lv.

09:35.560 --> 09:36.020
Chen.

09:36.240 --> 09:36.610
Han.

09:37.630 --> 09:38.850
The four of us Foundation Establishment cultivators

09:39.040 --> 09:39.780
