13:50.670 --> 13:52.100
we'll hold this place as a base

13:52.320 --> 13:53.490
and wait for reinforcements.

13:54.870 --> 13:55.370
Well then,

13:55.630 --> 13:56.370
Chen,

13:56.790 --> 13:57.300
Han.

13:58.080 --> 13:59.580
