Yes!

14:32.670 --> 14:33.180
Yes!

14:33.360 --> 14:34.420
What are your orders?

14:36.120 --> 14:36.730
Where is my wife?

14:37.480 --> 14:38.180
Latest news is

14:38.630 --> 14:39.610
that she safely arrived

14:39.630 --> 14:41.180
at the Six Sects' territory this morning.

14:45.790 --> 14:47.010
As for Li Feiyu...

14:47.550 --> 14:48.250
Still no sign?

14:48.480 --> 14:49.180
Scouts reported.

14:50.150 --> 14:51.010
No trace

14:51.120 --> 14:52.770
of Yellow Maple Valley disciples on the run.

14:57.320 --> 14:58.460
But they did spot

14:58.960 --> 15:00.650
a few cultivators from the Seven Sects

15:01.030 --> 15:02.220
heading southwest.

15:02.510 --> 15:03.130
Southwest?

15:05.320 --> 15:06.490
It's the Yan Clan Stronghold.

15:07.550 --> 15:09.060
Why would those fools go there?

15:10.510 --> 15:11.100
Let's find out.

15:11.840 --> 15:12.610
Young Master.

15:13.320 --> 15:14.460
There's nothing over there.

15:14.510 --> 15:15.700
Just rocky mountains.

15:15.790 --> 15:16.420
Wide open too.

15:16.670 --> 15:17.770
Are you sure we're going?

15:18.080 --> 15:18.850
Sure!

15:19.000 --> 15:19.820
No harm in taking a look.

15:25.720 --> 15:26.850
Stupid rock, worthless rock!

15:26.910 --> 15:27.610
Tripping Young Master!

15:27.630 --> 15:28.100
Shut up.

15:30.030 --> 15:31.460
Contact our men at the base.

15:32.600 --> 15:33.490
Find out

15:34.030 --> 15:35.610
what those fools are really up to.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.300
As you say, Young Master.

15:38.200 --> 15:39.700
There's a gem quarry there.

15:40.120 --> 15:41.300
I'll send word right away.

15:43.670 --> 15:44.300
Gem

15:44.870 --> 15:45.420
quarry?

15:46.200 --> 15:46.940
A quarry it is!

15:48.720 --> 15:49.610
What are we waiting for?

16:20.750 --> 16:21.250
I was in charge

16:21.480 --> 16:23.650
of the gem trade between Yan Clan

16:23.790 --> 16:24.850
and the Moonshadow Sect.

16:25.840 --> 16:26.420
Now that

16:26.600 --> 16:27.700
they've sided with the demonic sects,

16:28.630 --> 16:29.420
this ill-gotten wealth

16:29.960 --> 16:31.220
is now earned fair and square.

16:32.030 --> 16:33.700
Han from Yellow Maple Valley

16:34.360 --> 16:35.730
may seem like nothing special,

16:35.750 --> 16:37.180
but his strikes were sharp and clean.

16:37.720 --> 16:38.980
He caught me by surprise.

16:39.910 --> 16:40.980
So what if he's good?

16:42.240 --> 16:43.980
We have orders from the sect.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.060
Doesn't matter if he's elite or useless,

16:46.630 --> 16:48.580
he still has to follow our lead.

16:49.200 --> 16:50.340
Now, these gems

16:50.720 --> 16:51.940
seem to be under a seal.

16:52.670 --> 16:53.650
We'll have to break it

16:53.790 --> 16:54.820
before we can store these gems.

16:55.870 --> 16:56.300
So,

16:56.670 --> 16:57.940
we need to act fast.

16:58.670 --> 16:59.220
As I recall,

16:59.320 --> 17:01.060
you are quite skilled with sealing spells.

17:01.240 --> 17:01.940
So...

17:03.320 --> 17:03.980
I leave the place

17:04.720 --> 17:05.650
in your hands now.

17:09.870 --> 17:11.610
You've got a good eye, Xuan.

17:12.510 --> 17:13.580
Before the demon brats

17:13.630 --> 17:15.490
get here,

17:15.790 --> 17:16.460
let's grab

17:16.600 --> 17:17.420
as much as we can.

17:17.960 --> 17:18.730
But let's be clear.

17:21.320 --> 17:22.340
Whatever we get this time,

17:22.670 --> 17:23.850
we split it fifty-fifty.

17:24.510 --> 17:25.220
I promise

17:25.670 --> 17:27.130
you will get a fair share.

17:29.510 --> 17:30.890
You call the shots, Lv.

17:59.870 --> 18:00.820
The sentries are in position.

18:01.510 --> 18:02.820
The defense array is ready.

18:04.270 --> 18:05.180
Senior Chen

18:05.750 --> 18:06.850
truly lives up

18:07.790 --> 18:08.700
to her background.

18:12.960 --> 18:13.770
Mentor Chen.

18:14.720 --> 18:16.730
The array has been set up.

18:18.480 --> 18:19.890
We prepared plenty of gems.

18:20.550 --> 18:21.530
There won't be any mishaps.

18:28.600 --> 18:29.250
Our disciples

18:29.360 --> 18:30.420
are also on high alert.

18:30.550 --> 18:31.220
Go on ahead.

18:31.480 --> 18:32.490
I'll go to you later.

18:52.480 --> 18:53.010
Senior Chen,

18:54.000 --> 18:54.770
well done.

18:58.880 --> 18:59.380
This place...

19:00.720 --> 19:01.420
Han,

19:02.440 --> 19:03.570
I'm so glad you're alright.

19:05.070 --> 19:05.940
How's your injury?

19:08.960 --> 19:09.900
Thanks for your concern.

19:10.400 --> 19:11.660
I'm alright now.

19:12.240 --> 19:12.900
Good to hear.

19:15.310 --> 19:16.730
It's only been a few days,

19:17.030 --> 19:18.420
and you've already grown so skilled.

19:19.240 --> 19:19.980
You must've suffered a lot.

19:21.790 --> 19:22.660
You flatter me.

19:23.070 --> 19:23.530
They are

19:23.680 --> 19:25.290
only some unremarkable tricks.

19:29.640 --> 19:30.140
By the way,

19:31.310 --> 19:32.530
where are the two seniors?

19:33.400 --> 19:34.180
Do you know

19:34.680 --> 19:35.490
their next plan?

19:39.350 --> 19:40.530
When the seven sects coalition

19:40.640 --> 19:41.980
was picking scout teams,

19:42.550 --> 19:43.570
Senior Xuan and Senior Lv

19:43.590 --> 19:44.770
worked well together.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.140
They volunteered.

19:46.590 --> 19:47.620
But for some reason,

19:47.830 --> 19:48.700
they both disappeared

19:48.880 --> 19:49.980
after arriving at the quarry.

19:53.160 --> 19:54.290
This quarry is too important.

19:55.070 --> 19:55.770
I doubt Yan Clan

19:56.240 --> 19:57.220
and the demonic sects

19:57.440 --> 19:58.220
will just give it up.

19:59.240 --> 20:00.090
Once they regroup,

20:00.880 --> 20:01.530
they will return.

20:04.160 --> 20:05.420
This place has an array,

20:06.160 --> 20:07.180
but against the demonic army

20:07.790 --> 20:09.050
and Core Formation cultivators,

20:09.240 --> 20:10.050
it's not enough.

20:11.350 --> 20:12.180
If things go south,

20:12.830 --> 20:13.330
we'll all

20:14.070 --> 20:15.460
be trapped like fish in a barrel.

20:17.880 --> 20:18.660
You're right.

20:19.310 --> 20:21.250
It's not just about the defenses.

20:22.110 --> 20:24.050
We need those two late Foundation Establishment seniors

20:24.440 --> 20:25.730
to lay down a solid plan.

20:27.030 --> 20:27.730
I agree.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.380
Let's split up.

20:29.920 --> 20:30.660
Stay here.

20:30.960 --> 20:31.810
Prepare the array.

20:32.350 --> 20:33.140
I'll look for them.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.050
Mentor Chen.

20:38.030 --> 20:38.530
Mentor Chen.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.010
Where is the core

20:40.270 --> 20:41.530
of the Four-Menace Array?

20:47.750 --> 20:49.290
This quarry is like a maze.

20:50.270 --> 20:51.490
Where do these tunnels lead?

21:21.960 --> 21:22.860
I've got a bad feeling.

21:24.070 --> 21:24.900
Better find a spot

21:25.000 --> 21:25.700
to get ready.

21:52.400 --> 21:53.250
Nice and quiet here.

21:54.160 --> 21:54.660
Perfect.

21:55.240 --> 21:55.980
Time for my talismans

21:56.110 --> 21:56.770
and puppets.

22:26.110 --> 22:27.140
Hey little guy,

22:27.240 --> 22:28.250
where did you come from?

22:52.550 --> 22:53.290
You little rascal.

22:54.030 --> 22:54.810
Impeccable timing.

23:16.480 --> 23:16.940
All done.

23:43.640 --> 23:44.770
With enough gems,

23:45.200 --> 23:45.730
this will do.

23:48.000 --> 23:48.330
Alright,

23:49.440 --> 23:50.010
here's your task.

23:50.720 --> 23:51.180
Scout out

23:51.480 --> 23:51.940
the quarry.

24:42.680 --> 24:43.460
Great Deployment Art

24:43.640 --> 24:44.660
boosts my spiritual sense.

24:45.480 --> 24:46.570
With my current strength,

24:47.070 --> 24:48.140
plus these puppets,

24:48.750 --> 24:50.810
I can take on a mid Foundation Establishment cultivator.

25:25.270 --> 25:25.900
Who's there?

25:35.880 --> 25:37.900
His spirit sense is strong.

25:38.880 --> 25:39.900
Could he be in the late

25:40.240 --> 25:40.940
Foundation Establishment?

25:43.790 --> 25:44.220
No...

25:47.400 --> 25:48.980
The moment he saw me,

25:49.310 --> 25:50.700
he bolted like the wind.

25:51.790 --> 25:53.700
Could it be someone who knows me?

25:54.640 --> 25:55.460
Young Master!

25:58.310 --> 25:59.090
Young Master!

25:59.550 --> 26:00.420
Young Master!

26:02.000 --> 26:02.380
Young Master!

26:02.640 --> 26:03.220
Bad news!

26:03.680 --> 26:04.290
The quarry

26:04.720 --> 26:05.980
has been taken!

26:06.480 --> 26:07.050
By whom?

26:07.240 --> 26:08.620
The guys from the Seven Sects!

26:09.000 --> 26:09.900
The Seven Sects?

26:10.750 --> 26:11.620
And he knows me…

26:12.160 --> 26:14.090
The direction and distance match too…

26:15.400 --> 26:16.660
Could it be you?

26:17.510 --> 26:19.220
Li Feiyu!

26:21.270 --> 26:22.940
That villain never stops haunting me.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.620
I must leave.

26:47.590 --> 26:48.700
Hope Senior Chen sees it

26:49.160 --> 26:49.860
and gets ready.

26:51.750 --> 26:53.250
Yellow Maple Valley's emergency flare!

26:55.270 --> 26:57.860
Firing a signal at a time like this?

26:58.830 --> 27:00.700
Those Yellow Maple Valley fools...

27:01.750 --> 27:03.330
Die, all of you!

27:04.200 --> 27:05.530
Move out at full speed!

27:11.070 --> 27:12.730
A Yellow Maple Valley's emergency flare!

27:12.750 --> 27:13.250
Mentor Chen!

27:13.440 --> 27:14.330
Look, an emergency flare!

27:15.110 --> 27:15.730
We're under attack!

27:15.920 --> 27:16.220
Quick!

27:16.480 --> 27:17.860
Throw gems into the array core!

27:18.000 --> 27:18.900
Activate the defense array!

27:19.310 --> 27:20.140
Yes!

27:23.400 --> 27:23.940
Senior Chen!

27:24.200 --> 27:24.770
We're under attack!

27:25.030 --> 27:25.900
Was that your signal?

27:27.480 --> 27:28.980
Do we have enough gems to power the array?

27:29.680 --> 27:31.220
I sent people to collect a bunch.

27:31.830 --> 27:32.660
But this quarry is huge.

27:32.830 --> 27:33.900
Many areas are empty.

27:34.590 --> 27:35.290
It all depends on

27:35.480 --> 27:36.460
how many enemies there are.

27:37.830 --> 27:38.530
At least a hundred,

27:39.070 --> 27:39.980
but no siege weapons.

27:42.880 --> 27:44.330
Saber-Shearing Sect, Giant Sword Sect!

27:44.680 --> 27:45.290
Go look

27:45.440 --> 27:46.330
for more gems.

27:46.550 --> 27:47.090
The others,

27:47.240 --> 27:48.380
keep powering the array!

27:48.680 --> 27:49.290
Yes!

28:12.440 --> 28:13.380
Finally activated.

28:18.110 --> 28:19.290
This array is way too weak.

28:20.200 --> 28:21.980
It's all low-level cultivators out there.

28:24.510 --> 28:25.860
Are the seniors still not back?

28:26.720 --> 28:27.700
I haven't seen them either.

28:28.030 --> 28:28.700
Something's up.

28:28.880 --> 28:29.570
This is strange.

28:37.960 --> 28:38.490
Senior Chen,

28:39.110 --> 28:39.730
we're from the same sect.

28:40.070 --> 28:40.940
Let me offer a word.

28:41.680 --> 28:42.250
When it gets critical,

28:42.510 --> 28:43.420
we can't count on others.

28:44.110 --> 28:44.900
If things go south,

28:45.400 --> 28:46.330
retreat into the quarry.

28:46.720 --> 28:47.660
You just might survive.

28:50.440 --> 28:51.050
In a pinch,

28:51.350 --> 28:51.980
this might save you.

28:55.160 --> 28:55.900
I'll go look for them.

28:58.270 --> 28:59.620
Be careful, Han.

29:03.310 --> 29:04.010
Everyone

29:04.030 --> 29:05.770
in the Seven Sects knows me.

29:06.070 --> 29:06.530
You will

29:06.960 --> 29:07.810
get your share.

29:07.830 --> 29:08.250
Wait, no!

29:08.590 --> 29:10.220
Yellow Maple Valley just sent up a flare!

29:10.480 --> 29:10.940
The demonic sects

29:11.240 --> 29:11.940
are here!

29:13.750 --> 29:14.490
They are nothing.

29:14.830 --> 29:15.570
What's the panic?

29:16.270 --> 29:16.900
Keep working.

29:18.830 --> 29:20.140
Of all times to show up…

29:20.790 --> 29:21.860
Why now, of all times?

29:22.680 --> 29:23.220
Xuan,

29:24.240 --> 29:24.940
what do you think?

29:25.960 --> 29:27.460
I'll follow your lead, Lv.

29:29.750 --> 29:31.700
If the demonic sects send their main force,

29:32.440 --> 29:33.530
our array

29:34.350 --> 29:35.090
won't stand a chance.

29:37.310 --> 29:38.460
But if we pull everyone out,

29:38.960 --> 29:40.330
the array will collapse.

29:41.240 --> 29:41.810
Someone has to

29:42.310 --> 29:43.900
stay behind to cover the retreat.

29:44.350 --> 29:44.810
Right.

29:45.640 --> 29:46.530
Exactly right.

29:48.030 --> 29:49.900
The sect only sent us here

29:49.920 --> 29:51.700
to gather intel.

29:52.400 --> 29:54.090
As for where the gems end up,

29:54.680 --> 29:55.940
nobody will ask.

29:56.590 --> 29:57.380
Not the Seven Sects,

29:58.000 --> 29:58.940
not the demonic sects,

29:59.400 --> 30:00.810
and not the Yan Clan Stronghold.

30:02.350 --> 30:03.220
However,

30:03.720 --> 30:05.250
the cultivators from the other sects

30:07.070 --> 30:08.090
are a bit of a problem.

30:08.640 --> 30:09.180
Lv,

30:10.750 --> 30:11.770
under a falling nest,

30:12.030 --> 30:13.090
no egg survives.

30:13.720 --> 30:14.490
But still,

30:15.000 --> 30:16.380
if we don't join the defense

30:16.880 --> 30:18.700
and let Chen Qiaoqian

30:19.000 --> 30:20.090
go alone,

30:21.310 --> 30:22.570
people will start suspecting us.

30:28.400 --> 30:28.730
Got it.

30:30.510 --> 30:31.090
How about

30:31.200 --> 30:32.140
you and I each send two men

30:32.640 --> 30:33.570
to hold the fort?

30:34.240 --> 30:35.570
That should shut everyone up.

30:37.110 --> 30:37.570
Alright.

30:40.400 --> 30:41.300
Xiao Liu, Xiao Qi.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.090
Lan Yan, Lan Rong.

30:43.720 --> 30:44.290
Listen up.

30:46.880 --> 30:47.420
Right now,

30:47.880 --> 30:48.860
the quarry's under attack.

30:49.480 --> 30:50.730
It's a matter of life and death.

30:51.110 --> 30:52.940
Each of you, grab a box of gems.

30:53.110 --> 30:54.380
Get to the main hall fast.

30:54.550 --> 30:55.620
Power up the array.

30:56.310 --> 30:56.770
Yes!

30:58.480 --> 30:59.570
Go tell Chen Qiaoqian

30:59.960 --> 31:00.810
we'll be right there.

31:01.960 --> 31:02.330
Yes!

31:03.440 --> 31:03.730
You,

31:04.440 --> 31:05.010
start loading.

31:06.640 --> 31:07.090
Yes!

31:24.000 --> 31:25.660
Even the Four-Menace Array is used.

31:26.550 --> 31:28.290
Looks like we picked the perfect time.

31:28.920 --> 31:29.940
Right on time.

31:29.960 --> 31:31.180
They activated the Four-Menace Array.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.620
Li Feiyu, you little pest!

31:34.310 --> 31:36.090
I finally got you now.

31:36.750 --> 31:38.570
I'll vanquish you.

31:39.240 --> 31:39.940
Someone,

31:40.550 --> 31:42.770
tear open that turtle shell for me!

31:42.960 --> 31:43.380
Come on!

31:43.640 --> 31:45.090
Break open Young Master's shell!

31:46.960 --> 31:47.490
Now,

31:47.550 --> 31:49.860
open that turtle shell for the Young Master!

32:41.070 --> 32:42.090
All disciples, listen up!

32:42.590 --> 32:44.530
This quarry is crucial to our front line.

32:44.880 --> 32:45.620
We can't lose it!

32:46.590 --> 32:47.180
You two,

32:47.550 --> 32:48.570
keep powering the array.

32:49.350 --> 32:49.900
The rest,

32:50.070 --> 32:50.900
defend with full power!

32:52.350 --> 32:52.980
Yes!

33:03.200 --> 33:04.420
Still putting up a fight, huh?

33:16.590 --> 33:17.420
Scout ahead.

33:38.960 --> 33:39.420
Lv,

33:39.680 --> 33:40.460
it's about time.

33:40.590 --> 33:41.180
Let's pull out.

33:45.270 --> 33:45.980
No choice now.

33:47.270 --> 33:47.860
Let's go.

34:03.400 --> 34:03.980
Young master!

34:04.550 --> 34:05.010
Young master!

34:05.750 --> 34:06.490
If this drags on,

34:06.510 --> 34:07.860
we'll be stuck forever.

34:08.270 --> 34:09.140
How about I head back

34:09.160 --> 34:10.330
and bring some siege gear?

34:11.240 --> 34:12.290
Stop the barrage!

34:13.550 --> 34:14.490
Cease fire!

34:14.640 --> 34:15.770
Cease fire!

34:16.110 --> 34:16.810
Cease fire!

34:17.070 --> 34:17.570
Stop it!

34:21.550 --> 34:22.090
Look!

34:22.550 --> 34:23.490
The bombardment stopped!

34:25.030 --> 34:25.770
The Four-Menace Array

34:26.640 --> 34:28.570
isn't something a normal spell can break.

34:28.920 --> 34:30.180
Could this be Yan Clan's

34:30.200 --> 34:31.380
parting gift to us?

34:31.960 --> 34:32.810
Fight fire

34:33.350 --> 34:34.250
with fire!

34:35.000 --> 34:36.700
Too bad it's burning through gems.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.220
Prepare the Blue-Sun Blaze.

34:51.720 --> 34:52.810
Did I hear that right?

34:53.550 --> 34:54.530
Blue-Sun Blaze?

34:55.920 --> 34:56.420
Young master.

34:57.000 --> 34:58.290
That's a rare magic fire!

34:58.550 --> 34:59.620
It's not worth using here!

34:59.960 --> 35:01.050
Why do you care?

36:25.000 --> 36:25.860
That's the Blue-Sun Blaze!

36:37.400 --> 36:37.780
Keep going!

36:38.000 --> 36:38.460
Keep it up!

36:42.960 --> 36:43.340
Hurry!

36:43.480 --> 36:44.780
Keep powering the defense array!

36:53.440 --> 36:55.050
Are they freaks from the Demonic Flame Sect?

36:55.320 --> 36:55.860
That blast has

36:56.190 --> 36:57.690
the might of a Core Formation cultivator!

37:30.360 --> 37:31.610
Where are Xuan Yue and Lv Tianmeng?

37:31.760 --> 37:32.980
Why are there only four of you?

37:33.760 --> 37:35.940
They are still moving gems in the vault.

37:35.960 --> 37:37.090
They will be here soon.

37:39.360 --> 37:40.610
Keep bombing them.

37:46.360 --> 37:47.050
When it gets critical,

37:47.480 --> 37:48.300
we can't count on others.

37:48.710 --> 37:49.610
If things go south,

37:49.960 --> 37:50.820
retreat into the quarry.

37:51.320 --> 37:52.210
You just might survive.

37:53.550 --> 37:54.900
Everyone, listen up!

37:55.590 --> 37:56.490
The enemies are too strong.

37:56.960 --> 37:58.300
We can't hold this position.

37:58.840 --> 38:00.900
Saving yourselves is what matters most.

38:01.670 --> 38:03.090
Please don't hold back.

38:03.590 --> 38:05.820
Channel all your gems into the formation.

38:06.280 --> 38:07.300
Buy us some time.

38:45.800 --> 38:46.210
Move!

38:46.440 --> 38:47.650
Fall back into the quarry!

38:51.190 --> 38:51.780
Go!

39:47.880 --> 39:49.260
This turtle shell won't hold.

39:49.920 --> 39:50.260
Come on.

39:50.480 --> 39:51.460
It's a maze here.

39:51.880 --> 39:53.090
Where is the treasure?

39:53.400 --> 39:53.940
Almost there.

39:56.070 --> 39:56.940
Found them.

39:57.630 --> 39:58.650
Creeping around like rats.

39:59.480 --> 40:00.170
Looks like

40:00.550 --> 40:01.780
they've been here before.

40:03.000 --> 40:04.170
Two late Foundation Establishment cultivators.

40:04.590 --> 40:05.570
Two late Qi Refining cultivators.

40:06.070 --> 40:06.610
That's trouble.

40:07.360 --> 40:08.380
If they find out

40:08.670 --> 40:09.780
I know what they're up to,

40:10.510 --> 40:11.530
they will silence me.

40:12.110 --> 40:12.530
This is bad.

40:13.000 --> 40:13.460
I'd better run.

40:19.590 --> 40:20.130
Young master,

40:20.670 --> 40:21.690
that was the third shot.

40:24.110 --> 40:25.860
Our cultivators can't take much more.

40:26.760 --> 40:28.050
What do you know?

40:28.440 --> 40:29.170
Down there

40:29.630 --> 40:30.650
are the Seven Sects'

40:30.710 --> 40:32.170
elite meatheads

40:32.230 --> 40:33.740
and Li Feiyu!

40:33.960 --> 40:36.130
He dies here today, no matter what.

40:36.550 --> 40:37.740
Keep blasting!

40:57.440 --> 40:57.900
Move in!

40:58.400 --> 40:59.260
Go!

41:07.360 --> 41:07.740
Wait!

41:08.030 --> 41:08.570
Where is Mentor Chen?

41:08.800 --> 41:09.260
Run!

41:09.480 --> 41:10.210
Head into the quarry!

41:10.480 --> 41:10.900
Hurry!

41:11.110 --> 41:11.690
Run!

41:48.140 --> 41:53.460
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

41:54.700 --> 42:00.100
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

42:00.220 --> 42:03.420
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

42:03.660 --> 42:05.900
♪Old scenes rise again♪

42:06.300 --> 42:09.140
♪Too hard to forget♪

42:09.660 --> 42:13.620
♪Easier just to miss♪

42:14.460 --> 42:19.940
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

42:21.100 --> 42:26.380
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

42:26.980 --> 42:30.020
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

42:30.300 --> 42:32.420
♪Swept away by time♪

42:33.060 --> 42:35.700
♪Eyes once looked far♪

42:36.180 --> 42:40.140
♪Now lost in the shift♪

42:40.620 --> 42:43.460
♪Autumn winds stir♪

42:43.740 --> 42:45.660
♪Smoke curls once more♪

42:46.100 --> 42:48.540
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

42:48.860 --> 42:52.380
♪Returning to my eyes♪

42:52.940 --> 42:55.900
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

42:56.220 --> 42:59.140
♪Time lost its name♪

42:59.540 --> 43:02.380
♪Was it yesterday♪

43:02.780 --> 43:06.340
♪Or tomorrow?♪

43:06.700 --> 43:09.540
♪The world has changed♪

43:09.940 --> 43:11.780
♪Beyond recall♪

43:12.340 --> 43:14.060
♪Time will fade♪

43:14.460 --> 43:19.260
♪All the words ever spoken♪

43:19.940 --> 43:22.820
♪Only this longing remains♪

43:23.300 --> 43:28.580
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

43:29.700 --> 43:36.340
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

43:36.820 --> 43:46.540
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
